  "notes": "{振|ふ}り{分|わ}け means sorting or allocating things into groups.\n\nFORMS:\n{振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける (ichidan verb): to sort, to allocate, to distribute\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {仕事|しごと}を{振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける: to allocate work\n- {予算|よさん}を{振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける: to allocate budget\n- {担当|たんとう}を{振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける: to assign responsibilities\n\nUSAGE:\n- Business: task allocation, budget distribution\n- IT: routing, load balancing\n- Daily life: sorting items\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {割|わ}り{振|ふ}り: allocation (similar meaning)\n- {配分|はいぶん}: distribution\n- {分担|ぶんたん}: sharing of duties",
